title: Secure the Evidence
subtitle: Get our proof into safe hands before it can be destroyed.
is-card: true
tags: last_days
card-image: img/card_shadow.svg
view-if: finale and evidence >= 3 and not evidence_secured and not ld_evidence_used_today
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; ld_evidence_used_today = 1; last_card_timer = ""
new-page: true
on-display: {! SW.cardStuck(Q, this); !}

= Secure the Evidence

If [+ pal_title +] moves against us, the evidence we have gathered must survive.

- @do: Secure the Evidence.
- @easy_discard
- @set_aside

@do
on-arrival: evidence_secured = 1

Copies of the Caucus dossier are sent to Alderaan, Chandrila and an independent HoloNet station. Nothing new is learned. But what we know can no longer be burned, wiped or forgotten.
